{"speciesId":676,"names":{"fr":"Couafarel","es":"Furfrou","en":"Furfrou","ja":"トリミアン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Si son abondante fourrure gagne à être toilettée, ce n’est pas qu’une question de style. En effet, cela lui permet également de se mouvoir plus librement."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Cuando le esquilan su mullido pelaje, no solo mejora su apariencia, sino que aumenta su agilidad."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Trimming its fluffy fur not only makes it more elegant but also increases the swiftness of its movements."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"ボサボサの 体毛を 刈りこむと 姿が 美しくなる だけでなく 身体の キレが 良くなるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il y a fort longtemps dans la région de Kalos, ce Pokémon fut le gardien des rois et des reines."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Antiguamente, estos Pokémon desempeñaban el cometido de guardián del rey en la región de Kalos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Historically, in the Kalos region, these Pokémon were the designated guardians of the king."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"大昔の カロス地方では 王様を 護衛する 役目を 与えられた ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Si son abondante fourrure gagne à être toilettée, ce n’est pas qu’une question de style. En effet, cela lui permet également de se mouvoir plus librement."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cuando le esquilan su mullido pelaje, no solo mejora su apariencia, sino que aumenta su agilidad."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Trimming its fluffy fur not only makes it more elegant but also increases the swiftness of its movements."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"ボサボサの 体毛を 刈りこむと 姿が 美しくなる だけでなく 身体の キレが 良くなるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il y a fort longtemps dans la région de Kalos, ce Pokémon fut le gardien des rois et des reines."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Antiguamente, estos Pokémon desempeñaban el cometido de guardián del rey en la región de Kalos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Historically, in the Kalos region, these Pokémon were the designated guardians of the king."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"大昔の カロス地方では 王様を 護衛する 役目を 与えられた ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il fut un temps où la noblesse organisait des concours pour déterminer quel Couafarel arborait la plus belle coupe."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Hubo una época en la que los aristócratas competían entre ellos procurando que el corte de pelo de su Furfrou fuera el mejor de todos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"There was an era when aristocrats would compete to see who could trim their Furfrou’s fur into the most exquisite style."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"体毛を いかに 美しく カットするか 貴族たちの 間で 競われた 時代が あった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Sa fourrure pousse indéfiniment, mais il refuse de se faire couper la toison par une personne en qui il n’a pas confiance."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"El pelo le crece sin cesar, pero solo deja que se lo corten aquellos de quienes se fía plenamente."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Left alone, its fur will grow longer and longer, but it will only allow someone it trusts to cut it."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"放っておくと 体毛は どんどん 伸び続けるが 信頼した 者にしか カットは 許さない。"}],"varieties":[{"id":676,"moves":[{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[15,"level-up",5],[16,"level-up",5],[17,"level-up",5],[18,"level-up",5]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[15,"level-up",12],[16,"level-up",12],[17,"level-up",12],[18,"level-up",12]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[15,"level-up",35],[16,"level-up",35],[17,"level-up",35],[18,"level-up",35]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"tail-wh